  m_text: In addition to information that you give EA directly, EA collects certain information for purposes of improving our products and services, providing services to you, facilitating the provision of software updates, dynamically served content and product support, communicating with you as well as enhancing your experience when using EA products and services. This data will not be shared with any third party in a way that can identify you. When you disable usage data sharing, in addition to anonymous data, EA will continue collecting data reasonably necessary to operate the products and services. Disable usage sharing?
